Short:        Package manager for AmigaOS 3.x
Type:         util/misc
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0
Uploader:     duncan@bowring.us
Author:       Duncan Bowring
Version:      1.0

amiport - Package manager for classic AmigaOS 3.x

Written by Duncan Bowring. Original code (not a port).
Project: https://github.com/bdgscotland/amiport

The first package manager for classic 68k AmigaOS. Downloads,
verifies, and installs software packages from the amiport
repository at amiport.platesteel.net.

Requirements:
  - AmigaOS 3.0 or later
  - TCP/IP stack (Roadshow, Miami, or AmiTCP)
  - C:lha (for package extraction)

Commands:
  amiport list            Show all available packages
  amiport search <term>   Search by name or description
  amiport info <name>     Show package details
  amiport install <name>  Download, verify, and install
  amiport upgrade [name]  Upgrade outdated packages
  amiport remove <name>   Uninstall a package
  amiport installed       Show installed packages
  amiport doctor          Check network connectivity
  amiport help            Show usage

Configuration:
  S:amiport.conf          Optional config file (server URL, etc.)
  S:amiport.db            Installed package tracking database

Features:
  - SHA-256 download verification
  - Manifest caching for offline browsing
  - ANSI color output on Amiga console
  - Progress display during downloads
  - Proper AmigaOS exit codes (0/5/10/20)

Cross-compiled with m68k-amigaos-gcc for AmigaOS 3.x (68020+).
Tested on Amiga 2000 + Vampire V2 with Roadshow.
